        104.31244659423828
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        104.793701171875,
        520.9299926757812,
        143.51361083984375
      ],
      "text": "No, thankfully. There wouldn't be room. My cousin wants me to recommend a\nhotel. Do you know anywhere?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.45205688476562,
        128.062255859375,
        175.95346069335938
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        176.43470764160156,
        473.4587707519531,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "Yes, I do actually. I always recommend people stay at the King's Hotel.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        105.86299896240234,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        228.1547088623047,
        184.94320678710938,
        246.95361328125
      ],
      "text": "Where’s that near?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        259.89202880859375,
        128.062255859375,
        279.3934326171875
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        279.87469482421875,
        498.5724792480469,
        318.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "It’s about a five minutes walk from Murray Station, so nice and central. It's\nactually on George Street.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        331.4110412597656,
        105.86299896240234,
        350.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        351.5146789550781,
        161.81910705566406,
        370.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Oh yes, I know.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        383.2520446777344,
        128.062255859375,
        402.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.23468017578125,
        521.6617431640625,
        461.75360107421875
      ],
      "text": "I think they're on quite a tight budget, so how much roughly is it to stay there?\nIf you book a family room, it's about £125 per night. My brother paid for two\ndouble rooms in the end, and I think that was around £95 for each room.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.6920471191406,
        105.86299896240234,
        494.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        494.6746826171875,
        203.69924926757812,
        513.4735717773438
      ],
      "text": "Oh, that's not too bad.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        526.4110107421875,
        128.062255859375,
        545.9124145507812
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        546.3937377929688,
        269.7835388183594,
        565.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "So how old are your cousin’s kids?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        578.1320190429688,
        105.86299896240234,
        597.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        598.2347412109375,
        519.861328125,
        656.6336059570312
      ],
      "text": "Twelve and nine. So I want to organise some trips while they’re here. I was\nthinking of doing a bus tour of the city centre, as none of them have been here\nbefore.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        669.571044921875,
        128.062255859375,
        689.0724487304688
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        689.6747436523438,
        512.4124145507812,
        748.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Those bus tours are quite expensive. I think it's better to do a walking tour. It\ngives you a much better feel for the city. There’s one that starts from Colton\nSquare. It takes a couple of hours and doesn't cost that much.\n"
    }
